WORKFLOW ID:
nsp_scholarship_application

PORTAL:
National Scholarship Portal

FLOW:

1. Open browser.
2. Open new tab.
3. Navigate/search for the official National Scholarship Portal.
4. Verify official domain.
5. Open Student section.
6. Determine whether the user has completed OTR.
7. If OTR is required and incomplete:
      route to OTR workflow.
8. Authentication.
9. If OTP/security verification occurs:
      HUMAN.
10. Verify dashboard.
11. Identify academic year.
12. Search available scholarship schemes.
13. Read eligibility information.
14. Compare eligibility with verified user information.
15. If eligibility cannot be established:
      HUMAN REVIEW.
16. Select the intended scholarship scheme.
17. Start application.
18. Inspect personal-information section.
19. Fill verified personal information.
20. Inspect academic-information section.
21. Fill verified academic information.
22. Inspect institution information.
23. Fill verified institution information.
24. Inspect bank information.
25. Never invent bank information.
26. Inspect required documents.
27. Retrieve approved documents.
28. Verify each document.
29. Upload documents to matching fields.
30. Verify uploads.
31. Inspect all validation errors.
32. Resolve only errors supported by verified information.
33. Review complete application.
34. Compare application data against source data.
35. Detect contradictions.
36. Generate verification report.
37. Human approval.
38. Submit only after approval.
39. Verify submission.
40. Capture application ID/reference.
41. Store audit events.
42. Finish.